{
  "model": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base",
  "input": {
    "text": "要是我开口说：“今晚你比约定时间晚了约五十分钟，也没发消息”，后面怎么接？",
    "language": "Chinese",
    "voice_setting": {
      "voice_id": "qwen3-profile-551ba559eee40fce",
      "seed": 1536181804,
      "voice_profile": "男性，二十多岁，声音偏低而柔和，音色清亮，语速自然，情绪外露较明显。",
      "reference_text": "刚才我说自己一直等消息，他回我“你太敏感了”。为什么这句话一下就把争吵弄得更严重了？",
      "reference_directory": "/ytech_m2v8_hdd/workspace/kling_mm/zhengyuanhong/read_paper/全双工/duplex-env-scaling-package/project/duplex_v2/runs/20261109-v29-user-aside-hundred-service-recovery/branches/G05-N003-R01-V01/R01-V01/audio/voices/user-reference",
